note The selection and everything that moves with it: the centre and left tabs, the path and step (as slots in the map), the focused symbol, the open file and its line selection, the pending scrolls of the listing and the document (each with a ticket, so an older request cannot clear a newer one), the step at the top of the document and the one the outline last scrolled to, and the history. Views read it through accessors; only nav.rs writes it.

